      "content": "While competitors often resort to cost-cutting裁员, that strategy frequently erodes critical skills, innovation, and customer relationships that are hard to replicate. Accepting AI solely as a replacement tool can lead to short-term gains but risks long-term obsolescence if you lose the adaptability and problem-solving capacity your team provides. A more sustainable path might be to create a hybrid model where high-efficiency automation handles volume, allowing your remaining human resources to SPECIALIZE in complex negotiations, creative strategy, and rapid market adaptation to stay ahead of generic efficiency plays.",
